let read v = match (v : < box : < hit : int, miss : int >, other : int >) with | < box < hit 0 > > -> 100 | < box < hit 2 > > -> 200 | < box < hit n > > -> n + 1000 | < box < miss n > > -> n + 2000 | < other n > -> n + 400
let a = print_int (read (< box (< hit 0 >) >))
let b = print_int (read (< box (< hit 2 >) >))
let c = print_int (read (< box (< hit 3 >) >))
let d = print_int (read (< box (< miss 4 >) >))
let main = print_int (read (< other 5 >))
